<p> VW	     27,882  (5.1 pct) vs  25,996  (4.9 pct)</p>
<p> Citroen     26,366  (4.8 pct) vs  20,736  (3.9 pct)</p>
<p> Nissan	 23,071  (4.2 pct) vs  23,268  (4.4 pct)</p>
<p> Fiat	   21,526  (3.9 pct) vs  20,542  (3.9 pct)</p>
